    "text": "<br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image14-abb04e8f-b59f-4100-a1f7-7720efb31ff0.jpg\"/> <br >For first surface<br > <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br > <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> <br >For second surface<br > <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br > <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
